		(descr "Unvision M154-240240-RGB-8, 1.54in 240x240 ST7789V TFT module, SPI, 8-pin 2.54mm header, sold by Akizuki Denshi (akizukidenshi.com/catalog/g/g131019/). Dimensions per M154-240240-RGB-8.pdf mechanical drawing. NOTE: pad numbers follow the existing ST7789_1.3_240x240_LCD_Module symbol's pin numbering (1=VCC 2=GND 3=DIN 4=CLK 5=CS 6=DC 7=RST 8=BL), NOT the real module's physical left-to-right order. Pads are positioned so each symbol pin lands on the physically correct real pin (real order, left to right: GND VCC SCL SDA RES DC CS BLK). Do not renumber pads to match physical left-to-right order without also renumbering the symbol's pins, or VCC/GND, DIN/CLK, and CS/RST will swap again.")
